Maps Extended
=============

This project is **Maps Extended** — a standalone SPT map plugin (client + optional
server mod). It is not DynamicMaps, DynamicMaps Extended, or DynamicMaps Plus.

Maps Extended includes MIT-licensed software adapted from those upstream projects.
Attribution for that incorporated code is retained below as required by MIT.

